### Data License & Third-Party Notice
The MIT License applies strictly to the source code, smart contracts, scripts,
and documentation developed in this repository.

Agricultural, meteorological, and remote-sensing data files provided in `data/`
remain under the open-access licenses and terms of their respective original providers:
- Weather data contains modified Copernicus Climate Change Service information (ERA5-Land via Open-Meteo).
- Satellite NDVI contains modified Copernicus Sentinel data (Sentinel-2 Level-2A).
- Soil moisture data is provided by the NASA-USDA Enhanced SMAP Global Soil Moisture project.
See `THIRD_PARTY.md` for complete third-party licenses and data attribution terms.
